Subject: [PATCH 1/4] redesign: ops-console portfolio for projects

Restyle the project list and detail pages to the approved ops-console
design: terminal-style hero index, two-column case-study card grid,
All / AWS / Kubernetes / DevOps / Lab / Production filters mapped to
category, type, and status, and a sticky anchor subnav on detail pages.
No project content, routes, Payload schema, or deployment scripts
changed. Presentation-only.
